{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buckle Up!</strong> is a 2\u20136 player online party shooter where quick matches and unpredictable moments keep everyone on their toes. Jump into fast-paced rounds with friends or strangers, switch up your strategy on the fly, and try not to fall off the train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match brings a new challenge, with different gamemodes, weapons to upgrade, and plenty of ways to mess with your opponents. Win by scoring points, outplaying your rivals, or just staying on board a little longer than everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/1cc2c45b90a9bf7c79b5ae835305ca1a.poster.avif?t=1774265134\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/1cc2c45b90a9bf7c79b5ae835305ca1a.webm?t=1774265134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the chaos with up to 6 players in online multiplayer. Play with friends or find new rivals in public lobbies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/7505627f8217970d05b11253aaa3f290.poster.avif?t=1774265134\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/7505627f8217970d05b11253aaa3f290.webm?t=1774265134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're stealing flags, holding hills, dodging players with bombs, or just going full deathmatch, there's always a new way to win or lose!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/7fc76daf0edd2fa7fadede13bc1a571d.poster.avif?t=1774265134\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/7fc76daf0edd2fa7fadede13bc1a571d.webm?t=1774265134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect upgrades for your weapons mid-match. Adapt on the fly with special weapons and game-changing pickups then unleash chaos on your competition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/503a25a32996818b0d71b369f6504517.poster.avif?t=1774265134\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/503a25a32996818b0d71b369f6504517.webm?t=1774265134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outplay your friends, grab the high score, and fight for the top spot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/d27a5db73b67ab382bba363f854c7bcd.poster.avif?t=1774265134\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/extras/d27a5db73b67ab382bba363f854c7bcd.webm?t=1774265134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your personality with customizable outfits and characters. From stylish to downright ridiculous.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620720?t=1774265134","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620720?t=1774265134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/4d3e8f9d18fa9c762a2d4482d01f0d8d3932d49e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774265134","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620720/4d3e8f9d18fa9c762a2d4482d01f0d8d3932d49e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774265134","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3750850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buckle Up!</strong> is a 2\u20136 player online party shooter where quick matches and unpredictable moments keep everyone on their toes. Jump into fast-paced rounds with friends or strangers, switch up your strategy on the fly, and try not to fall off the train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match brings a new challenge, with different gamemodes, weapons to upgrade, and plenty of ways to mess with your opponents. Win by scoring points, outplaying your rivals, or just staying on board a little longer than 